# A DHCPINFORM of a Windows client (RFC 2131 section 4.4.3): ciaddr 198.51.100.77, host
# name, vendor class MSFT 5.0 and the Windows INFORM parameter request list; padded to 300
# octets. Modelled by hand on the option order and parameter request list this client
# sends; documentation addresses (RFC 5737) and MACs (RFC 7042).
#
# op 1, htype 1, hlen 6, hops 0
01 01 06 00
# xid
a1 01 22 12
# secs, flags
00 00 00 00
# ciaddr 198.51.100.77
c6 33 64 4d
# yiaddr 0.0.0.0
00 00 00 00
# siaddr 0.0.0.0
00 00 00 00
# giaddr 0.0.0.0
00 00 00 00
# chaddr
00 00 5e 00 53 22 00*10
# sname: empty
00*64
# file: empty
00*128
# magic cookie
63 82 53 63
# option 53: DHCPINFORM
35 01 08
# option 61: client identifier, type 1 and the MAC
3d 07 01 00 00 5e 00 53 22
# option 12: host name "WS-22"
0c 05 57 53 2d 32 32
# option 60: vendor class identifier "MSFT 5.0"
3c 08 4d 53 46 54 20 35 2e 30
# option 55: parameter request list
37 0d 01 0f 03 06 2c 2e 2f 1f 21 79 f9 2b fc
# end
ff
# padding to 300 octets
00*15
